,"articyId":"72057821671262373","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Do you know about the technical limitations of the implants?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you know about the technical limitations of the implants?","TextSheVersion":"Do you know about the technical limitations of the implants?","TextTheyVersion":"Do you know about the technical limitations of the implants?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1550.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34341","byteOffset":20874744,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_47E789B2","articyId":"72057821671262380","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"LifeCorp doesn't encourage discussion of these issues.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"LifeCorp doesn't encourage discussion of these issues.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1850.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28060","byteOffset":18497968,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_82F0156F","articyId":"72057821671262387","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"But the flaws are common knowledge.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But the flaws are common knowledge.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2150.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24224","byteOffset":17040584,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_7772BF37","articyId":"72057821671262394","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Did you ever write memories for Automatas?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Did you ever write memories for Automatas?","TextSheVersion":"Did you ever write memories for Automatas?","TextTheyVersion":"Did you ever write memories for Automatas?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2450.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29119","byteOffset":18896864,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_EFEE5859","articyId":"72057821671262401","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"Why would I do that? Easier to just erase the old Automata and code a new one than to mess with memories.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why would I do that? Easier to just erase the old Automata and code a new one than to mess with memories.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2750.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31354","byteOffset":19741808,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_C53E354B","articyId":"72057821671262408","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"But theoretically it would be possible.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But theoretically it would be possible.","TextSheVersion":"But theoretically it would be possible.","TextTheyVersion":"But theoretically it would be possible."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3050.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34009","byteOffset":20747360,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_3422672E","articyId":"72057821671262415","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"It's extremely difficult.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's extremely difficult.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3350.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27072","byteOffset":18121288,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_438783CE","articyId":"72057821671262422","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Harder than with real people? Why is that?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Harder than with real people? Why is that?","TextSheVersion":"Harder than with real people? Why is that?","TextTheyVersion":"Harder than with real people? Why is that?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3650.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44827","byteOffset":31292520,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_BB796EF4","articyId":"72057821671262429","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"Their memories come with all kinds of checksums and other integrity tests.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Their memories come with all kinds of checksums and other integrity tests.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4250.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17313","byteOffset":14439008,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_0C1A8CDB","articyId":"72057821671262436","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"Human consciousness has the ability to reform and reshape itself when it experiences... trauma. Like the trauma of memory loss.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Human consciousness has the ability to reform and reshape itself when it experiences... trauma. Like the trauma of memory loss.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4550.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52058","byteOffset":34109664,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_326A8C7D","articyId":"72057821671262443","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"For Automata, they tend to unravel. Like a stacked tower of blocks, removing one can make the whole thing collapse.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"For Automata, they tend to unravel. Like a stacked tower of blocks, removing one can make the whole thing collapse.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4850.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39878","byteOffset":29414680,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_4E45456E","articyId":"72057821671262450","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"So if an Automata remembers something, it's genuine memory?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So if an Automata remembers something, it's genuine memory?","TextSheVersion":"So if an Automata remembers something, it's genuine memory?","TextTheyVersion":"So if an Automata remembers something, it's genuine memory?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5150.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17497","byteOffset":14507400,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_55968A09","articyId":"72057821671262457","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"Not always. But almost always.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not always. But almost always.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5450.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23501","byteOffset":16769824,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_FB22D615","articyId":"72057821671262472","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"Human consciousness is resilient, but Automata sentience is more... fragile. Personality collapse is common when you interfere with core memories.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Human consciousness is resilient, but Automata sentience is more... fragile. Personality collapse is common when you interfere with core memories.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46637","byteOffset":31976200,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_F566F0B1","articyId":"72057821671262480","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"But have you tried it personally?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But have you tried it personally?","TextSheVersion":"But have you tried it personally?","TextTheyVersion":"But have you tried it personally?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5150.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16928","byteOffset":14294744,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_156E05B2","articyId":"72057821671262487","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"Not by my own hands. But I watched the process.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not by my own hands. But I watched the process.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5450.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45584","byteOffset":31576848,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_83E7E55B","articyId":"72057821671262494","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"Complex and messy. Like trying to sew with spaghetti. And the results can be unsightly. In my opinion, it's a waste of time.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Complex and messy. Like trying to sew with spaghetti. And the results can be unsightly. In my opinion, it's a waste of time.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5750.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22837","byteOffset":16523608,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_04E86F17","articyId":"72057821671267436","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"I heard you're designing memory implants for criminals?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I heard you're designing memory implants for criminals?","TextSheVersion":"I heard you're designing memory implants for criminals?","TextTheyVersion":"I heard you're designing memory implants for criminals?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":950.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27457","byteOffset":18269480,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_8CDDD0B9","articyId":"72057821671267443","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"JR Amiga","text":"Yes. No one does it better.","speakerId":"Ntt_1F18DC48","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes. No one does it better.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":125